{"id": "g3-034", "domain": "board game", "names": ["Pawn", "Dice", "Board"], "groups": {}, "text": "Board game. Is there a group yet? No? Then please group Pawn and Dice together as Pieces and bring Board to the back.", "wires": [{"span": "Is there a group yet", "trigger": "Is there a group", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "kind": "group"}}, {"span": "group Pawn and Dice together as Pieces", "trigger": "group", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Pawn,Dice", "name": "Pieces"}}, {"span": "bring Board to the back", "trigger": "bring", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Board"}}]}
{"id": "g3-035", "domain": "load balancer", "names": ["Web1", "Web2", "Web3", "Lb"], "groups": {"Farm": ["Web1", "Web2", "Web3"]}, "text": "Load balancer view. Put Lb above Farm, then connect Lb to Web1, Web2 and Web3. Take Web3 out of Farm, it is being retired, and delete Web3.", "wires": [{"span": "Put Lb above Farm", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Lb", "position": "above", "anchor": "Farm"}}, {"span": "connect Lb to Web1, Web2 and Web3", "trigger": "connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Lb", "to": "Web1,Web2,Web3"}}, {"span": "Take Web3 out of Farm", "trigger": "Take", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "ungroup", "target": "Web3"}}, {"span": "delete Web3", "trigger": "delete", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "Web3"}}]}
{"id": "g3-036", "domain": "party", "names": ["Cake", "Gift1", "Gift2", "Table"], "groups": {}, "text": "Birthday party table. Gather Gift1 and Gift2 into a group called Gifts, set Gifts to pink, and put Gifts right of Cake. Is Table in any group?", "wires": [{"span": "Gather Gift1 and Gift2 into a group called Gifts", "trigger": "Gather", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Gift1,Gift2", "name": "Gifts"}}, {"span": "set Gifts to pink", "trigger": "set", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Gifts", "color": "pink"}}, {"span": "put Gifts right of Cake", "trigger": "put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Gifts", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Cake"}}, {"span": "Is Table in any group", "trigger": "in any group", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "groupOf", "target": "Table"}}]}
{"id": "g3-037", "domain": "hydrology", "names": ["Dam", "Lake", "River"], "groups": {"Basin": ["Lake", "River"]}, "text": "Hydrology map. Put Dam above Basin and make Dam huge. I'll ungroup Basin later. Is Dam in a group?", "wires": [{"span": "Put Dam above Basin", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Dam", "position": "above", "anchor": "Basin"}}, {"span": "make Dam huge", "trigger": "huge", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Dam", "size": "huge"}}, {"span": "Is Dam in a group", "trigger": "in a group", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "groupOf", "target": "Dam"}}]}
{"id": "g3-038", "domain": "staff", "names": ["Alice", "Bob", "Carol", "Dave"], "groups": {"Interns": ["Alice", "Bob"]}, "text": "Which group is Carol in? I never made one for her. Move Interns to the bottom, bring Interns to the front, and add Carol to Interns because she started last week.", "wires": [{"span": "Which group is Carol in", "trigger": "Which group", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "groupOf", "target": "Carol"}}, {"span": "Move Interns to the bottom", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Interns", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "bring Interns to the front", "trigger": "bring", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "Interns"}}, {"span": "add Carol to Interns", "trigger": "add", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Carol,Interns", "name": "Interns"}}]}
{"id": "g3-039", "domain": "electronics", "names": ["Led1", "Led2", "Led3", "Res"], "groups": {}, "text": "put all the red circles together and also bundle the blue stars as Cool. Put Res near Cool.", "wires": [{"span": "put all the red circles together", "trigger": "together", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "mention(color=red,quantifier=all,shape=circle)"}}, {"span": "bundle the blue stars as Cool", "trigger": "bundle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "mention(color=blue,quantifier=all,shape=star)", "name": "Cool"}}, {"span": "Put Res near Cool", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Res", "position": "near", "anchor": "Cool"}}]}
{"id": "g3-040", "domain": "logistics", "names": ["Truck1", "Truck2", "Truck3", "Depot"], "groups": {"Convoy": ["Truck1", "Truck2", "Truck3"]}, "text": "Logistics. Distribute Convoy horizontally and move Convoy 40 pixels up. Then put Depot left of Convoy and ungroup Convoy once the trucks are placed.", "wires": [{"span": "Distribute Convoy horizontally", "trigger": "Distribute", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Convoy", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"span": "move Convoy 40 pixels up", "trigger": "move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Convoy", "direction": "up", "distance": "40"}}, {"span": "put Depot left of Convoy", "trigger": "put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Depot", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Convoy"}}, {"span": "ungroup Convoy", "trigger": "ungroup", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "ungroup", "target": "Convoy"}}]}
